    "productDescriptionProps": {
      "paragraphs": [
        "BÅRSLÖV sofa-bed comes with soft shapes and generously sized, comfortable cushions that make it a perfect place to sink into.",
        "This sofa converts quickly and easily into a spacious bed when you remove the back cushions and pull out the underframe.",
        "Storage space under the chaise. The lid stays open so you can safely and easily take things in and out.",
        "The chaise longue can be placed either to the left or right, so you can adapt the sofa to your space and your preferences.",
        "The cover has been treated with easy-care, which means that spills won’t seep into the fabric, but stay on the surface and are easily absorbed with a dry cloth.",
        "The fixed sofa cover is made of TIBBLEBY, a dope-dyed polyester fabric with a soft surface, light luster and a discreet herringbone pattern.",
        "10-year limited warranty. Read about the terms in the limited warranty brochure."
      ],
